  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Education Sector Support Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Solomon Islands Education Sector Support Program supports the Solomon Islands Government (SIG) to implement its National Education Action Plan 2016-2020 (NEAP) and the subsequent NEAP 2022-2026. The  investment, also supported by New Zealand, aims to improve outcomes in basic education (Years 1-9).</narrative>
  </description>
